{"kind": "mod", "id": 2076, "name": "Hideout In Progress", "slug": "hideout-in-progress", "teaser": "Turn in items for hideout construction as you get them!", "owner_name": "Tyfon", "downloads": 47000, "favourites": 80, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.tyfon.hideoutinprogress", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Hideout", "category_id": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:13:29.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-02T09:30:00.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-04-02T09:30:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "2.0.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Features</p>\n<p>Contribute resources to hideout upgrades as you get them.</p>\n<p>This mod for SPT adds a “Transfer Items” button to hideout construction/upgrade windows. Clicking this button will contribute any items in your stash towards the upgrade, and the UI will update to reflect the remaining resources required.</p>\n<p>Some things to keep in mind:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cash is not contributed early, and will be payed in full when you finally start the upgrade</li>\n<li>Items contributed cannot be retrieved</li>\n<li>Fully contributed items will no longer be auto-wishlisted</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Technical details</h3>\n<p>Contributions are stored in the user profile data, in /SPT/user/profileData/PROFILE_ID/Tyfon.HideoutInProgress.json. Modifying that file is like modifying your profile - do so at your own risk. If you delete the file, your contributions will be gone and you’ll need the original count of items to upgrade your hideout areas.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<p>Like almost every mod here, extract the zip archive into your SPT directory.</p>\n<p>I recommend using <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7zip</a> to extract and install this mod.</p>\n<p>Example (thanks DrakiaXYZ for the gif)</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Example\" /></p>\n<h3>Uninstallation</h3>\n<p>To uninstall, simply delete:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>&lt;your SPT folder&gt;/BepInEx/plugins/Tyfon.HideoutInProgress.dll</strong></li>\n<li><strong>&lt;your SPT folder&gt;/SPT/user/mods/Tyfon.HideoutInProgress.Server.dll</strong></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Troubleshooting</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Troubleshooting</p>\n<p><strong>Q: I found a bug!</strong></p>\n<p>A: Open an <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/tyfon7/AutoDeposit/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">issue</a> or make a comment here. Please include logs if possible!</p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you’d like to support my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/tyfon\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a> ☕</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3728, "published_at": "2025-07-31T21:06:04.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2076/hideout-in-progress/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3507, "published_at": "2025-09-09T21:07:12.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2076/hideout-in-progress/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 22063, "downloads": 5319, "published_at": "2025-10-23T15:32:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2076/hideout-in-progress/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 21833, "downloads": 3014, "published_at": "2025-12-03T22:35:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2076/hideout-in-progress/2.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 22115, "downloads": 18934, "published_at": "2025-12-27T17:33:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2076/hideout-in-progress/2.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["tyfon7/hip"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/tyfon7/hip", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}